<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Household International.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Household International.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it resumed coverage of Household International Inc as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Household gained 11/16 to 115.</p>
